                            "thread_id": "",
                            "user_id": "1",
                            "message": "Test Case: 1\n\nTest Case Title: Successful Login to Facebook\nModule: Login\nPriority: High\n\nPreconditions: \n- User has a valid Facebook account.\n- User is on the Facebook login page.\n\nTest Steps:\n1. Enter a valid email address or phone number in the Email or Phone field.\n2. Enter the correct password in the Password field.\n3. Click the Log In button.\n\nExpected Result:\n- User is successfully logged in and redirected to their Facebook news feed. \n- The user’s profile picture and name are displayed at the top of the page.\n- No error messages are shown.",
